re made once,<br>and <i>kept for ever.</i></h1><div class=\"hl-rule\">❖</div><p>Rosewood, teak and camphor, joined without screws by our own craftsmen in Melaka. Commissioned, never mass-produced.</p><a class=\"hl-btn\" href=\"{{p:collections}}\">View the collections</a> <a class=\"hl-btn o\" href=\"{{p:enquire}}\">Request a quotation</a></div></div></section><section class=\"hl-sec\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hl-title\"><span class=\"num\">The collections</span><h2>Three ways to furnish a house</h2></div><div class=\"hl-col\"><a href=\"{{p:collection}}\"><div class=\"ph soft\" data-l=\"The Dining Room\"></div><div class=\"roman\">I</div><h3>The Dining Room</h3><p>Tables for twelve, sideboards that hold a century of china.</p></a><a href=\"{{p:collection}}\"><div class=\"ph soft\" data-l=\"The Study\"></div><div class=\"roman\">II</div><h3>The Study</h3><p>Writing desks, library steps and glass-fronted cabinets.</p></a><a href=\"{{p:collection}}\"><div class=\"ph soft\" data-l=\"The Chamber\"></div><div class=\"roman\">III</div><h3>The Chamber</h3><p>Four-posters, wardrobes and dressing tables.</p></a></div></div></section><section class=\"hl-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"hl-bespoke\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"letter-spacing:.35em\">Bespoke commissions</span><h2 style=\"font-weight:400;margin:14px 0 18px\">Designed with you, drawn to scale</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom:26px\">Bring a photograph, a measurement or a memory. We return a drawing within ten days.</p><a class=\"hl-btn\" href=\"{{p:bespoke}}\">Begin a commission</a></div><div class=\"d\"><h2>How a commission proceeds</h2><ol class=\"hl-steps\" style=\"margin-top:24px\"><li><span>Consultation at the salon or at your home</span></li><li><span>Scale drawings and timber selection</span></li><li><span>Construction, with visits to the atelier</span></li><li><span>Delivery, placement and signing of the piece</span></li></ol></div></div></div></section><section cla